    "updated_at": "2022-08-12T09:30:47Z",
    "body": "Internally in Gecko Event objects do have a flag whether they are being handled by a passive listener. We could expose that to JS. It would be a rather ugly API (since Event shouldn't care or know about the listener), but perhaps practical?",
